{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink doorbell feels like a natural next choice because it adds front-door alerts and two-way communication alongside my existing Blink camera.",
    "The smart plug offers a new practical use for my connected home: automating a lamp. Alexa speakers and displays also fit that setup, although I do not have a strong need for them now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "More Fire TV sticks repeat something I already have covered with my 4K stick and Fire TV television; the HD stick gives me even less reason to choose it.",
    "The tablet does not address a current need, and a themed remote cover does not make another streaming stick useful to me."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to keep suggesting streaming devices, even though those purchases already meet my viewing needs.",
    "Sharing Alexa or Amazon branding seems to count too much; compatibility interests me, but it does not give every speaker, display, or tablet a purpose in my home."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I am more interested in adding a useful capability, such as front-door communication or lamp automation, than duplicating devices I already own.",
    "An item can fit my setup without being something I would choose now: the speakers and displays appeal to me, but the doorbell has a clearer immediate use."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my interest in connected home devices, but gave too much weight to familiar products and too little to what would add a useful function now."
}"}
